1
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:17,500
Those who ceaselessly hone the art
of killing are known as masters.

2
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:22,157
These lethal abilities, dutifully
passed down through many generations,

3
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:25,200
have become what are
called modified bloodlines.

4
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:28,837
This is the story of one such master,

5
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:32,720
Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan
and his greatest challenge yet,

6
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,180
to get married.

7
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,906
When I met the one with
my mind of the truth..

8
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:00,570
Blood,

9
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:10,900
I'm happy to be a bit shy.

10
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:12,493
I'm happy to be my one.

11
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:17,764
If you like me, I'll take
my five to 10, please.

12
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:22,460
I'm sick, I'm happy to be your first time.

13
00:01:46,813 --> 00:01:47,643
Kill or kiss.

14
00:01:47,726 --> 00:01:48,556
Toxic.

15
00:01:49,552 --> 00:01:50,382
Toxic.

16
00:01:54,117 --> 00:01:54,947
Kill or kiss?

17
00:01:55,030 --> 00:01:55,860
Let's go!

18
00:01:55,943 --> 00:01:56,773
Kill again, kill, kill again!

19
00:01:56,856 --> 00:01:57,717
Kill again, kill, kill again!

20
00:01:57,800 --> 00:02:01,400
Kill again, kill, kill again!

21
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:11,255
She's the real head of the Beast Clan?

22
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:13,177
Then that means Toshiro is...

23
00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:15,337
Well done, but I'll take it from here.

24
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:17,740
I assume you won't object?

25
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:28,780
The two of you are such good
boys, knowing not to overstep.

26
00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:32,920
It's the wild dogs who get put down.

27
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:40,660
By the way, Hikaru, based on what
I've heard, you're looking for a mate.

28
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:46,238
Something tells me you
wouldn't mind becoming my pet.

29
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:52,880
As the heads of our families, no
doubt we'll meet again. Who knows?

30
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:56,569
Maybe the five great families
will move towards unification.

31
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,560
Well, guess we're done here. Huh?

32
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,060
You shift gears fast.

33
00:03:10,340 --> 00:03:11,820
Just what all's left?

34
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:14,020
I mean, we saved Misadashiyama.

35
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:17,097
The Beast Clan's plot,
it's not happening now.

36
00:03:17,180 --> 00:03:18,010
Right.

37
00:03:18,093 --> 00:03:18,923
You have a point.

38
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:22,500
Actually, the hard part, that's up next.

39
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:24,251
The whole marriage thing.

40
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:27,860
You know, I'll root for you.

41
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:29,040
It'll work out.

42
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:33,010
Hey!

43
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:34,720
He caught a Gator!

44
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:42,120
Still in one piece? Somehow. We managed.

45
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,860
I want to thank all of you.

46
00:03:57,380 --> 00:04:00,357
And now you're gonna get the
full taste of our gratitude!

47
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:02,440
We've prepared a little something.

48
00:04:04,220 --> 00:04:06,580
Modified bloodline increments.

49
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:29,800
Little critters, thanksgiving
extravaganza! Ingenza!

50
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:56,846
Rebrand, girl, and become
the cuteness master!

51
00:04:58,080 --> 00:05:00,900
Here it comes, the big climax!

52
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:02,250
Hit it!

53
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:07,270
Date!

54
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:10,504
We hope this expresses
just how grateful we are!

55
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,746
This whole ordeal taught
me a valuable lesson.

56
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:25,140
Small fry masters like me can put
on a nice show, and that's about it.

57
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:28,560
But that's fine by me.

58
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,620
I'll still live with my head held up high.

59
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,390
Awesome.

60
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:38,500
Really, all of you are cool as hell.

61
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,520
Sure are!

62
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:51,517
It was at that moment
world-class marriage swindler,

63
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:55,440
Mei Kinosaki, belt the spark
between Gero and Arashiyama.

64
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:58,789
We're not letting this
opportunity slip by.

65
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:03,360
Okay, who here saw last
week's Twisted Ropes?

66
00:06:03,580 --> 00:06:04,620
Me, of course.

67
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:07,537
I didn't know you were also
a die-hard fan of ropes.

68
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:09,660
Now to steer this conversation.

69
00:06:10,380 --> 00:06:14,177
Speaking of exciting dates, this one
time I went on a private jet ride.

70
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:15,237
Who are you seeing?

71
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,340
Oil Baron.

72
00:06:16,780 --> 00:06:21,192
Within minutes, I've expertly shifted
the conversation to love and romance.

73
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,440
Boring subject.

74
00:06:26,180 --> 00:06:30,437
Oh, by the way, you haven't told us
what your girlfriend is like, Piichi.

75
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:31,932
She's the best there is.

76
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:37,640
Seeing her smile gives me the
courage to take on any job.

77
00:06:37,980 --> 00:06:41,797
And coming home to dinner with
her makes my exhaustion melt away.

78
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,180
When I have a day off,

79
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:47,360
spending it with her gives me the
strength to handle the days after.

80
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:50,480
I realize I'm not a decent person.

81
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:54,457
All of the normal happiness
humans feel that I'm aiming for,

82
00:06:54,540 --> 00:06:56,780
I learned entirely from my girlfriend.

83
00:06:57,540 --> 00:07:02,060
For as long as I live, for better
or for worse, she's the one for me.

84
00:07:04,180 --> 00:07:07,980
In order to protect her,
I would do anything.

85
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:09,320
I mean it.

86
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,920
Pichi Nakagawa!

87
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:17,000
You said that without a
hint of embarrassment!

88
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:19,460
Is this it?

89
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,720
THE POWER OF NATURAL CHARM!

90
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:27,200
Like a Casanova over
here. Wanna see a picture?

91
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:31,509
I didn't count on that, but it
certainly turned up the heat.

92
00:07:31,820 --> 00:07:32,860
O-M-G.

93
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:34,552
That's what it is, fire!

94
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:38,522
It's time we talked, because
Arashiyama's head over heels for you.

95
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:42,460
But her feelings?

96
00:07:42,700 --> 00:07:44,700
They're also a double-edged sword.

97
00:07:45,460 --> 00:07:49,872
Since she idolizes you, if the illusion
breaks, things could end like that.

98
00:07:50,080 --> 00:07:52,600
This won't be like Ureshino or Himekawa.

99
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:54,527
You need to be more careful.

100
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:58,551
Gedo's grown a lot, so a pep
talk should get him pumped up.

101
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:00,200
You got it?

102
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:05,677
All you have to do is play
it cool like Piichi did,

103
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:08,289
and when the time's
right, get them digits.

104
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:11,459
Ready to introduce her to
the new and improved Gedo?

105
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:14,880
Ah, we're almost back to shore.

106
00:08:15,820 --> 00:08:17,477
Well, I guess this means goodbye.

107
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:18,390
Hi!

108
00:08:18,473 --> 00:08:21,100
Kinosaki-style cording
arts, bridge builder!

109
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:24,860
I'm sure gonna miss you and
your hammies, Arashiyama.

110
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:27,200
Yeah, me too. I bet!

111
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:29,620
That's your cue!

112
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:31,900
Make your move, kiddo!

113
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,520
I wanted to say...

114
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,117
You mean she likes me?

115
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,030
For real?

116
00:08:46,113 --> 00:08:47,600
You're not pulling my leg?

117
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:49,460
Why would she like me?

118
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:51,860
Why would anyone like me?

119
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:55,460
Come on, focus! Don't freeze up!

120
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:58,057
Is this because I told
him about her feelings?

121
00:08:58,140 --> 00:08:59,081
Was it too soon?

122
00:08:59,660 --> 00:09:00,560
Look at him!

123
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,584
He can't even construct a word!

124
00:09:02,860 --> 00:09:05,213
He'll never get her number at this rate!

125
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:07,660
Hikaru-Gero!

126
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:11,464
What's the matter with
you, cat-got-your-tongue?

127
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,797
Shoot! It's hopeless.

128
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:20,840
Better put out this fire and
try to salvage whatever's left?

129
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:25,260
How about I go first then?

130
00:09:31,460 --> 00:09:33,100
I like you.

131
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:41,540
Did someone say something?

132
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,520
I, uh, like you.

133
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:51,580
There's just one problem.

134
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:54,580
I can't be the one who marries you.

135
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,150
Huh?

136
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:59,460
I overheard you were
looking for a partner.

137
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:02,460
And thought maybe I had a shot.

138
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:04,260
But no.

139
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:06,800
This might sound dumb.

140
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:08,472
But I'm not good enough.

141
00:10:08,820 --> 00:10:10,040
At least not yet.

142
00:10:13,180 --> 00:10:17,380
I don't feel confident about my work,
and I'm an emotional train wreck.

143
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:23,420
Even if by some miracle I got you to accept
me, I'd be dependent on you. A burden.

144
00:10:23,860 --> 00:10:24,837
Being dead weight.

145
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,979
That's the last thing I would want.

146
00:10:27,540 --> 00:10:28,420
I'm sorry.

147
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:31,537
I know this is totally
half-assed and self-centered,

148
00:10:31,620 --> 00:10:33,417
but I'm going to build myself up.

149
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:35,200
Until I'm crazy independent.

150
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,118
Then I'll confess my feelings again.

151
00:10:39,540 --> 00:10:40,940
You saved my life!

152
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:42,390
Thank you!

153
00:10:42,473 --> 00:10:44,558
I just did the job I was told to do.

154
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:50,377
Instead of being the same little girl who
idolized you, I'll become a strong woman.

155
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:52,225
The kind that can support you.

156
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:55,154
I'm gonna make you fall for me so hard!

157
00:10:55,420 --> 00:10:56,740
You better be ready!

158
00:11:02,380 --> 00:11:03,820
I bet I sound crazy!

159
00:11:03,940 --> 00:11:05,058
Don't listen to me!

160
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,580
Too late for that.

161
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:15,120
I don't really know what to say, someone
like you, thinking so much about me.

162
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:22,140
Never once in my whole life has a
person said anything like that to me.

163
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,680
I'll wait for you.

164
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,720
Yeah? Same.

165
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:44,758
Until then, would it be okay
if we exchanged numbers?

166
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:46,590
Sure!

167
00:11:46,673 --> 00:11:48,052
They're a perfect match!

168
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:49,040
Do it already!

169
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:54,840
Added, you're in my
contacts now. Same for you.

170
00:11:56,020 --> 00:11:58,255
Well, at least they're hitting it off.

171
00:12:00,020 --> 00:12:02,640
I'm aiming to form the perfect marriage.

172
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:05,200
For both of them.

173
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:11,057
Send my fee with the extra
charges to the designated account.

174
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:13,577
If you miss the payment
deadline, I'll kill you!

175
00:12:13,660 --> 00:12:14,920
Bye-bye?

176
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:17,760
Did she seem mad?

177
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:20,380
When did Piichi leave?

178
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:21,540
He was right here

179
00:12:23,940 --> 00:12:25,937
Welcome back, honey bunches?

180
00:12:26,020 --> 00:12:27,608
It's good to be back, Mary!

181
00:12:27,980 --> 00:12:29,060
How did it go?

182
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:34,220
It's just group activities
aren't your thing Hmm,

183
00:12:34,660 --> 00:12:39,189
so an overnight on an island with a
bunch of strangers sounds a little rough.

184
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:41,380
Oh, well, yeah,

185
00:12:41,660 --> 00:12:47,300
it was kind of weird at first, I guess, but
I got along pretty okay with those guys.

186
00:12:47,860 --> 00:12:49,077
Well, is that so?

187
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:52,572
In that case, sounds like you
ended up making new friends.

188
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:54,577
Hold on a sec.

189
00:12:54,660 --> 00:12:55,860
Do you think so?

190
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:01,740
Oh, also, I learned how to
prep and cook a giant squid.

191
00:13:02,060 --> 00:13:03,942
How do you feel about ink pasta?

192
00:13:04,540 --> 00:13:05,740
I love it.

193
00:13:05,900 --> 00:13:08,018
We should add it to the cafe's menu.

194
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:10,230
Yeah.

195
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:14,140
So what's next for you, Arashiyama?

196
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,080
Well, I'm glad you asked.

197
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:20,097
I'm going into business and
starting my own detective agency.

198
00:13:20,180 --> 00:13:24,940
Not the entertainment industry
after that show you put on for us?

199
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,240
It was incredible.

200
00:13:27,940 --> 00:13:30,528
Being a detective is
so much cooler, though.

201
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:35,865
Besides, I want to find out where
my big brother disappeared to.

202
00:13:39,220 --> 00:13:40,280
See you around.

203
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,790
Arashiyama.

204
00:13:45,873 --> 00:13:48,180
She's great, but she's not the only one.

205
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:50,310
Himekawa.

206
00:13:50,820 --> 00:13:51,680
Ureshino, too.

207
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:56,159
They're all beyond amazing, and
they've all been putting the work in.

208
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:59,920
I need to do the same
and be way more charming.

209
00:14:00,900 --> 00:14:04,480
I'll be a man who's worthy of their love!

210
00:14:08,940 --> 00:14:13,437
Then I'll whip you into shape with my
patented training of a thousand doormans!

211
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:14,360
Please do.

212
00:14:33,380 --> 00:14:34,960
Good evening, Taduaki.

213
00:14:41,340 --> 00:14:43,634
How's our new poison that treating you?

214
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,360
Is it everything you hoped for?

215
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:50,411
I nearly died, and I've never been better.

216
00:14:52,060 --> 00:14:54,980
So, teacher, what can I do for you?

217
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:58,200
It's concerning Master Hikaru's marriage.

218
00:15:00,740 --> 00:15:01,800
Tell me more.

219
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:09,869
I've got good vibes
from all three of them.

220
00:15:10,260 --> 00:15:11,672
There's my boss at work,

221
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:13,597
a guy my age from a different school,

222
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:16,739
and an underclassman I met
at a club in junior high.

223
00:15:17,700 --> 00:15:20,017
There's no way I could
pick only one of them,

224
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:22,571
seeing as how I love each of them to bits.

225
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:24,480
Help me out, advisor.

226
00:15:24,980 --> 00:15:26,100
What should I do?

227
00:15:27,780 --> 00:15:29,100
I see your problem.

228
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:33,037
Now all three of them want to take
me out on a date for my birthday.

229
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:33,980
Oh, really?

230
00:15:34,220 --> 00:15:35,050
But you know...

231
00:15:35,133 --> 00:15:36,360
Romantic counseling?

232
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:37,950
Yep.

233
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:42,720
May the love evangelist, followers
only, kiss your worries goodbye.

234
00:15:44,900 --> 00:15:49,177
Next time, while I'm doing my side hustle,
I want you to sit in on the sessions.

235
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:50,800
Why would I ever...

236
00:15:51,540 --> 00:15:54,220
Is this it? My practice?

237
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:55,660
To max my charm?

238
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:58,800
It went over Himekawa,
Ureshino, and Arashiyama?

239
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:01,460
The training of a thousand torments.

240
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:04,998
I've endured a hundred
already only nine hundred left

241
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,400
I say bring it on

242
00:16:10,540 --> 00:16:13,540
So what am I supposed to do now? Well,

243
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:16,677
this is just a suggestion
But why don't you triple

244
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:19,097
book so you can hang out
with all three of them?

245
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:20,780
I never thought of that

246
00:16:22,420 --> 00:16:27,880
Thanks a bunch good luck
either you so about my birthday

247
00:16:29,140 --> 00:16:32,060
Please let that be the toughest one. Yo!

248
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:35,853
Before school ends, I've got
to ask out the team manager!

249
00:16:36,460 --> 00:16:38,920
Only all the other players like her too!

250
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:41,757
But no one's feelings for
her are stronger than mine!

251
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:45,280
How do I score the final
try and win over her heart?

252
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:47,209
You should field this one.

253
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:59,380
For starters, be yourself
around her. What else?

254
00:16:59,700 --> 00:17:01,360
Be polite. Got it!

255
00:17:01,940 --> 00:17:03,080
Thanks, coach!

256
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:04,680
Good luck!

257
00:17:05,340 --> 00:17:06,170
Hmm!

258
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:08,920
Break time.

259
